- The app renders inside a fixed 1:√2 (≈1:1.414) aspect ratio container that fits within the screen, matching A4 paper proportions. Portrait displays get a tall container, landscape displays get a wide one.
- Every UI component must be designed for both orientations. Always consider how the layout adapts between portrait and landscape.
